#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/threadx.md:38
msgid ""
"The resolver checks the Board identity and its explicit backend declaration."
" CPU-only runtime assemblies can select Native, Cortex-M3 or Cortex-M4/M4F "
"profiles. Board assemblies supply the SoC, route and startup facts. The "
"F103RB software reference uses HSI8, SysTick at 1 kHz, BASEPRI and the "
"Cortex-M3 soft-float ABI. Its physical qualification is pending."
msgstr ""
"解析器校验板卡身份及明确声明的后端。纯 CPU 运行时装配可以选择 Native、Cortex-M3 或 Cortex-M4／M4F。板卡装配提供 "
"SoC、走线和启动事实。F103RB 软件参考选择 HSI8、1 kHz SysTick、BASEPRI 和 Cortex-M3 软浮点 "
"ABI。实板验收仍待执行。"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/threadx.md:44
msgid "Authoring"
msgstr "编写配置"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/threadx.md:65
msgid ""
"The `board` locator selects the reviewed package; its actual identity is "
"then validated. Product tasks, queue payload/depth, stack budgets and "
"startup/stop policy stay external. Public task priorities increase with "
"their numeric value. The adapter reverses that order into ThreadX native "
"numbering, where smaller numbers run first. Pass logical priorities to "
"common task APIs, never raw ThreadX priority numbers. All controls start "
"zeroed and stacks use byte capacity. Call `nx_os_run` for the real "
"bootstrap; successful entry never returns, and Platform startup does not "
"enter the scheduler."
msgstr ""
"`board` 定位符选择已审包，随后验证其实际身份。产品任务、队列 "
"payload／深度、栈预算及启动／停止政策保持外置。公共任务优先级随数值增加而提高；适配器将其反向映射到数值越小优先级越高的 ThreadX "
"原生编号。公共任务 API 使用逻辑优先级，不能直接传 ThreadX 原生优先级编号。所有控制对象首次清零，栈使用字节容量。通过 "
"`nx_os_run` 进入真实 bootstrap，成功不返回；Platform 启动不进入调度器。"

